Package: obt
Title: Drive the OutbreakTools Designer and Linelist from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Komlavi Yves", "Amevoin", , "Yves.Amevoin@akyves.net",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R wrapper around the OutbreakTools designer and the linelist
    workbook buttons, so the steps normally driven from the Excel interface
    can be scripted from R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    cli,
    readxl,
    readxlsb,
    rlang,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils,
    writexl
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    withr
Remotes:
    velofrog/readxlsb
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/Needs/development: devtools
SystemRequirements: Microsoft Excel, on macOS or on Windows, for the
    operations that open a workbook. On any other system the package loads
    and recipes build and print, and obt_commit() is turned down.
URL: https://github.com/epicentre-msf/obt
BugReports: https://github.com/epicentre-msf/obt/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
